[DOC title=":Pages / About"]

	# standalone

	This project documents components with sdocs **without installing it** — the
	docs server runs via `npx sdocs run` (or the local CLI from the monorepo).

	## What it covers

	- The no-install CLI flow
	- Host-only dependencies (`clsx`) resolving from this project
	- Plain-JS components documented via JSDoc

	And a page example, staged in the project context:

	[example title="Chips"]
		<Chip label="One" active />
		<Chip label="Two" />
	[/example]

